# Manually-installed apt packages (apt-mark showmanual, minus the base image).
# NOT all installed by default — step 10 filters this list:
#   • boot/firmware + kernel        -> always skipped
#   • third-party (Docker/VSCodium/Bruno/Cursor/flatpak) -> owned by steps 20/50
#   • desktop/locale/IME            -> only with INSTALL_DESKTOP=1
# Essential/base packages (dash, grep, coreutils, …) are intentionally NOT listed
# here — they're always present, so reinstalling them is pure noise.
